  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il peut terrasser ses ennemis d’un coup\nde la lame enchâssée dans son armure,\net les faire taire d’un seul regard.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "One swing of the sword incorporated in\nits armor can fell an opponent. A simple\nglare from one of them quiets everybody.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Les pièces d’armure sur ses pattes\nantérieures sont de grandes lames.\nUn simple cri peut intimider son ennemi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Part of the armor on its anterior legs\nbecomes a giant sword. Its cry alone\nis enough to intimidate most enemies.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "In the time it takes a foe to blink,\nit can draw and sheathe the seamitars\nattached to its front legs.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/21/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "In the time it takes a foe to blink,\nit can draw and sheathe the seamitars\nattached to its front legs.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "てきが　まばたきする　あいだに\nまえあしに　ついた　アシガタナで\nあいてを　きりつけ　もとにもどせる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "상대가 눈을 깜빡이는 동안에\n앞다리에 붙어 있는 각검으로\n상대를 베고 원래대로 되돌린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il dissimule de grandes lames qu’il dégaine en un\néclair des fourreaux de ses pattes antérieures.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ehe man sichs versieht, hat es schon das\nLangschwert aus seinen Vorderbeinen gezogen\nund seinen Gegner besiegt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "En un abrir y cerrar de ojos, puede desenvainar y\nenvainar los sables que hay en sus patas delanteras.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Riesce a estrarre le sue spade, colpire il nemico\ne riporle al loro posto nelle zampe anteriori in un\nbatter d’occhio.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "In the time it takes a foe to blink, it can draw and\nsheathe the seamitars attached to its front legs.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "敵が　瞬きする　あいだに\n前足に　ついた　アシガタナで\n相手を　切りつけ　元に戻せる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "En un abrir y cerrar de ojos, puede desenvainar y\nenvainar los sables que hay en sus patas delanteras.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "よろいに　しこまれた　つるぎの\nひとふりで　あいてを　たおす。\nひとにらみで　てきを　だまらせる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "갑옷에 내장된 검으로 한칼에\n상대를 제압한다.\n눈빛만으로 상대를 침묵시킨다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il peut terrasser ses ennemis d’un coup de la lame\nenchâssée dans son armure, et les faire taire d’un\nseul regard.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Besiegt Gegner durch einen einzigen Hieb mit\nder Klinge an seinem Panzer. Ein böser Blick\nund seine Feinde verstummen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Derriba a su rival con un solo tajo del sable que lleva\nen su coraza. Acalla al enemigo con una simple\nmirada.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
